[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084160+00:00] │                                   Billing                                    │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084209+00:00] │                                                                              │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084257+00:00] │ Billing issues dominated the week, accounting for 49.4% of conversations.    │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084322+00:00] │ Customers expressed frustration over billing errors and subscription         │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084374+00:00] │ management difficulties, although they appreciated the support team's        │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084435+00:00] │ responsiveness. The free-tier resolution rate was notably low at 39.5%,      │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084503+00:00] │ while the paid tier achieved a perfect resolution rate. A customer expressed │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084567+00:00] │ their frustration: "Yesterday, 10 dollars were taken from my account, I      │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084615+00:00] │ canceled the subscription because I don't use this tool. Can I request a     │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084670+00:00] │ refund?" (originally in Polish).                                             │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084737+00:00] │                                                                              │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084802+00:00] │                               Product Question                               │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084864+00:00] │                                                                              │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084931+00:00] │ Product-related inquiries made up 29.1% of the conversations, with customers │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.084980+00:00] │ frustrated by disappearing presentations and file losses. However, they      │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085026+00:00] │ appreciated the support that helped recover their work. The free-tier        │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085074+00:00] │ resolution rate was high at 95.3%, with the paid tier again achieving 100%.  │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085120+00:00] │ A customer noted: "I can't upload images into my gamma board...".            │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085169+00:00] │                                                                              │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085232+00:00] │                                   Account                                    │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085296+00:00] │                                                                              │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085349+00:00] │ Account management issues accounted for 8.7% of the conversations. Customers │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085397+00:00] │ appreciated the ability to manage their accounts but were frustrated by      │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085444+00:00] │ email change issues and missing credits. The free-tier resolution rate was   │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085494+00:00] │ 90.3%, with the paid tier at 100%. One customer shared: "Hello, I can't find │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085541+00:00] │ my account, I am logging in with my email..." (originally in Spanish).       │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085586+00:00] │                                                                              │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085637+00:00] │                                     Bug                                      │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085701+00:00] │                                                                              │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085754+00:00] │ Bugs were a concern in 4.6% of conversations, with customers frustrated by   │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085801+00:00] │ non-working links and presentation errors. The free-tier resolution rate was │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085849+00:00] │ 76.8%, while the paid tier achieved 100%. A customer reported: "my top       │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085894+00:00] │ navigation bar disappeared and it's not coming back".                        │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.085948+00:00] │                                                                              │
