[2025-11-25T21:42:30.086319+00:00] │ recover lost work. The free-tier resolution rate was 93.4%, with the paid    │
[2025-11-25T21:42:30.086410+00:00] │ tier at 100%. A user expressed: "Hello. I purchased a domain through Gamma   │
